      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "采矿区那边好......热闹？我好像听到麦尼尔先生在与谁大声争执。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_hesitant",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "阿梅利亚",
            "content": "原来，是架吵到一半特地抽空来和我们打招呼的......怎么说......还有点感动。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4236_tmslot_confused",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "char_4236_tmslot",
              "animationName": "Smile",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "麦尼尔太太，听您先生刚才的口气......这次钻矿井的把握有多大？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_blank",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "content": "......真是瞒不过聪明的孩子。现在我们面临的问题是燃料不足。平台离最理想的靶区还有一段距离，但这已经是我们的极限了。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "content": "我们需要从这里开始挖掘，把剩余的燃料精打细算地用到最后一滴......然后，不管掘到的是财富还是荒土，都接受结果。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "也就是说，需要一次成功......那确实好让人紧张。现在在为什么事争执呢？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_thinking_openmouth",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "content": "你们知道他的脾气。既请了人来帮忙，又不信任他们。对于怎么处置最后的燃料，他和他请来的探矿师各执一词，谁也说服不了谁。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "content": "或许你们可以帮忙劝劝他。你们的话，说不定他还乐意听一些。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "我们会试试的。有机会的话，我们很想见证这次钻井。希望......不，一定要成功。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_serious",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "content": "太感谢你们了。一起去采矿区看看吧。只不过有点不好意思，得麻烦你们跟老头子一样，从这堆杂物中间挤过去了。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "pauseOnEnd": false,
              "id": "npc_002_agoldw_2",
              "animationName": "Talk"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "没关系，我来帮忙挪开，以后进出也更方便啦。",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_wink",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
